body:
Studio sidebar shows the same object list regardless of which package is selected. Root cause: `getMetaItems()` filters via `SchemaRegistry.listItems(type, packageId)`, then unconditionally merges **all** items from `MetadataService.list(type)` — wiping out the package filter.

### Changes

- **`packages/objectql/src/protocol.ts`** — Filter `MetadataService.list()` results by `_packageId` before merging when a `packageId` scope is active
- **`packages/runtime/src/http-dispatcher.ts`** — Same fix on the MetadataService fallback path in `handleMetadata()`

```typescript
// Before: merged ALL runtime items regardless of package filter
const runtimeItems = await metadataService.list(request.type);

// After: respect package scope
let runtimeItems = await metadataService.list(request.type);
if (packageId && runtimeItems && runtimeItems.length > 0) {
    runtimeItems = runtimeItems.filter((item: any) => item?._packageId === packageId);
}
```
